            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">If a character unit from your army with the leader ability can be attached to a Reiver Squad, it can be attached to this unit instead. If a character is attached to this unit, its movement characteristic becomes 7&quot;.</characteristic>
